    "the ones worth spot-checking. Correct any entry here and the previous-portfolio",
    "block picks it up on the next run -- no code change needed.",
    "",
    "An ISIN that is missing from this map is NOT silently benchmarked to NIFTY 50;",
    "model_portfolio.py leaves it blank and the UI names the scheme so it can be added."
